rl="https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/feed_rss_updated.xml">小渺的个人记录</source><comments>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/MQ/rabbitmq/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/MQ/rabbitmq/</guid> </item> <item> <title>rocketmq部署</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;部署 RocketMQ 通常包括以下几个步骤，从简单的单机部署到生产级的集群部署，以下是详细步骤：&lt;/p&gt; &lt;hr&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;一、环境准备&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.操作系统&lt;/strong&gt;：&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;[ ] Linux 是推荐的环境，但也支持 Windows。&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.依赖环境&lt;/strong&gt;：&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;[ ] JDK 1.8 或更高版本（Java 环...&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</description> <link>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/MQ/rocketmq/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:25:02 +0800</pubDate> <source url="https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/feed_rss_updated.xml">小渺的个人记录</source><comments>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/MQ/rocketmq/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/MQ/rocketmq/</guid> </item> <item> <title>HAProxy_Keepalived部署</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;一、最终架构&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;假设有：&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;| 角色 | IP | | ----- | ------------------- | | LB01 | &lt;code&gt;192.168.1.10&lt;/code&gt; | | LB02 | &lt;code&gt;192.168.1.11&lt;/code&gt; | | VIP | `192....&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/HAProxy_Keepalived%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:25:02 +0800</pubDate> <source url="https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/feed_rss_updated.xml">小渺的个人记录</source><comments>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/HAProxy_Keepalived%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/HAProxy_Keepalived%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Keepalived</title> <description>&lt;h2&gt;什么是 Keepalived？&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keepalived&lt;/strong&gt; 是一个高可用性（High Availability, HA）软件，主要用于在 Linux 系统中实现 &lt;strong&gt;虚拟 IP 漂移（VIP漂移）&lt;/strong&gt;，从而提供服务的高可用性。它经常与 &lt;strong&gt;LVS（Linux Virtual Server）&lt;/strong&gt; 配合使用...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/Keepalived/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:25:02 +0800</pubDate> <source url="https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/feed_rss_updated.xml">小渺的个人记录</source><comments>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/Keepalived/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/Keepalived/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Keepalived部署</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;Keepalived 的部署其实非常简单，下面是一个完整的部署步骤，包括安装、配置和启动服务&lt;/p&gt; &lt;hr&gt; &lt;h2&gt;一、环境准备&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;假设：&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;主节点 IP：192.168.1.10&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;备节点 IP：192.168.1.11&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;虚拟 IP（VIP）：192.168.1.100&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;网卡名：&lt;code&gt;eth0&lt;/code&gt;（你...&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</description> <link>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/Keepalived%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:25:02 +0800</pubDate> <source url="https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/feed_rss_updated.xml">小渺的个人记录</source><comments>https://yinzhipeng123.github.io/markdown_log/middleware/load_balance/Keepalived%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaL